{"name": "Punch Upon a Time", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Punch Upon a Time</strong> is a team-based Smash-like where you take on rounds of mini-games and combat alongside your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"230\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/e41a208efb7bcff1e05045698963e2b4.poster.avif?t=1787381895\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/e41a208efb7bcff1e05045698963e2b4.webm?t=1787381895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/e41a208efb7bcff1e05045698963e2b4.mp4?t=1787381895\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your favorite hero or villain from our stacked roster of 11 fairy tale and fable legends! Or play as an adorable little frog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"230\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/d2d272774faeb5736aabaa8083154a0d.poster.avif?t=1787381895\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/d2d272774faeb5736aabaa8083154a0d.webm?t=1787381895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/d2d272774faeb5736aabaa8083154a0d.mp4?t=1787381895\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Team up with a pair of friends</strong> or queue solo and take to the skies in <strong>Squad Saga</strong>, where your team's sky galleon acts as home base between rounds of competition against <strong>3 Opposing Squads</strong>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategize with your Squad about upcoming matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick a <strong>Pocket Item</strong> to carry into your next match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeat opponents to damage their sky galleon and become the last Squad standing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"230\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/60eb5d664d05d562ed6d9bff7de37b3e.poster.avif?t=1787381895\" width=\"610\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/60eb5d664d05d562ed6d9bff7de37b3e.webm?t=1787381895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/extras/60eb5d664d05d562ed6d9bff7de37b3e.mp4?t=1787381895\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embrace the chaos as each round of <strong>Squad Saga </strong>is randomly selected from our massive pool of game modes! Dunk the competition in a game of <strong><i>Basketball</i></strong>, out-last your adversaries in <strong><i>Red-Light-Green-Light</i></strong>, or knock out the enemy monarch in <strong><i>Long Live the King</i></strong>.\u00a0No two <strong>Squad Sagas</strong> will play the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 Player Online Rollback Netcode\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ Items to clobber and befuzzle your opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40+ Modes to test your team's skill and highlight your character's power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Matchmaking and Custom Lobbies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Punch Upon a Time is a team-based party fighter inspired by Smash Bros where you take on rounds of modes, mini-games, and combat alongside your friends. Assemble a squad of the biggest fairy tale names to punch, dunk, fly, score, and sumo your way to victory as the LAST TEAM STANDING.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485570/18a2d8e920550675887050b3f38cef979a79718f/header.jpg?t=1787381895", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Fighting", "Multiplayer", "Co-op", "PvP", "Action", "Party Game"], "developers": "Supersaurus", "publishers": "Supersaurus", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4485570", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "22 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/IzYVc45oZdQ", "first_seen": 1787349600.0, "review_rank": 60}